          ],
          "evidence_anchors": [
            "SRC-004"
          ],
          "suggestions": [
            "Expand the caption of Figure 1 to explicitly describe the visual elements, such as which colors represent participating versus unparticipating clients and how the participation gap is indicated."
          ]
        },
        {
          "statement": "The paper is well-organized with a clear logical flow from the introduction of the two-level framework to the derivation of fast rates and then to unbounded losses.",
